Description: Open client for Cisco AnyConnect VPN with Fortinet SAML/SSO
 OpenConnect is a VPN client compatible with Cisco AnyConnect, Juniper SSL,
 Pulse Connect Secure, F5 BIG-IP, Fortinet, Palo Alto GlobalProtect, and
 Array Networks SSL VPN servers.
 .
 This build adds Fortinet SAML/SSO support based on upstream MR !632, plus
 a local per-host overrides framework (/etc/openconnect/local-overrides.conf)
 for forcing SAML, using the system default browser, or disabling IPv6 on
 specific gateways.
